WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.917 --> 00:00:08.576
At laminator 1, the job due now: bags for Kraški pršut d.o.o..

2
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:18.980
The operator scans the lot label of each film and the adhesive.

3
00:00:19.622 --> 00:00:34.008
She scanned a newer roll. The terminal names the older lot LOT-2597 still in the store. The oldest film goes first: its surface treatment weakens with age. A suggestion, never a block.

4
00:00:34.636 --> 00:00:49.545
She takes the older lot, then the other film and the adhesive.

5
00:00:50.162 --> 00:00:59.061
Every lot is scanned: the job starts. Each reel of it will carry these lots.

6
00:00:59.681 --> 00:01:12.592
The first reel: 6,000 m from the counter, 425 kg typed from the scale.

7
00:01:13.217 --> 00:01:25.909
Refused: this laminate at that length should weigh 531 kg. Metres and kilograms are both measured, so a wrong figure is caught at the machine, not at month end.

8
00:01:26.531 --> 00:01:33.872
Weighed again: 528 kg.

9
00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:41.237
The reel is confirmed and its label prints, with a barcode for the next step.

10
00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:49.954
The web breaks. She records the stop with its reason.

11
00:01:50.577 --> 00:02:00.584
Back running: 14 kg of scrap booked on the stop that caused it.
